
<html>

<head>
<title>Pokeschool Signup</title>
</head>

<body bgcolor="#FFFFFF">

<p align="center"><big><big><strong><font face="Arial">Pokeschool.com Signup</font></strong></big></big></p>

<!--#INCLUDE FILE="/template/bannersystem.txt"-->

<form method="POST">
  <div align="center"><center><table border="0" cellpadding="1" width="600"
  bgcolor="#FFCC66">
    <tr>
      <td><table border="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFCC66" width="100%">
        <tr>
          <td><strong><font face="Arial">User Information</font></strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td bgcolor="#FFFFCC" nowrap><font face="Arial">To receive an account you must agree to the
          <a href="/data/terms.html">terms and conditions</a>.</font><p><font face="Arial"></font></p>
          <p><font face="Arial">Fill out all of the required information.</font></p>
		<table>
			<tr>
              <td colspan=2><div align="right">
			  <p align=justify>
			  <font face="Arial">
			  Your site name and password can contain NO spaces, NO uppercase letters and NO characters other than those in the Alphabet and numbers.<p>
			  
			  </td>
            </tr>
		</table>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0">
            <tr>
              <td width="120"><div align="right"><p><font face="Arial">Site Name</font></td>
              <td><small><font face="Arial">&nbsp;<input type="text" name="username" size="20"
              style="background-color: rgb(255,255,255)" value=""></font></small></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0">
            <tr>
              <td width="120"><div align="right"><p><font face="Arial">Password</font></td>
              <td><small><font face="Arial">&nbsp;<input type="text" name="password" size="20"
              style="background-color: rgb(255,255,255)" value=""></font></small></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0">
            <tr>
              <td width="120"><div align="right"><p><font face="Arial">Email</font></td>
              <td><small><font face="Arial">&nbsp;<input type="text" name="email" size="20"
              style="background-color: rgb(255,255,255)" value=""></font></small></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0">
            <tr>
              <td width="120"><div align="right"><p><font face="Arial">Real name</font></td>
              <td><small><font face="Arial">&nbsp;<input type="text" name="real_name" size="20"
              style="background-color: rgb(255,255,255)" value=""></font></small></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0">
			<tr>
			<td colspan=2>
			</td>
			</font>
			</td>
			</tr>
          </table>



          <table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0">
            <tr>
              <td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </td>
            </tr>
          </table>


          <p><input type="submit" value="Submit" name="signup"> <input type="reset" value="Reset"><br>
</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
<font face=arial>
<align=justify>
<b>NOTE:</b> When you hit the Submit button you WILL recieve an error message similar to:<p align=justify>
'E:/Pokeschool/cgi-bin/hosting/signup.cgi' script produced no output
<p align=justify>
 ALL aspects of this program are working and you can log into your account by hitting the back button and <a href=/cgi-bin/hosting/manager.cgi><b>CLICKING HERE</b></a> after you recieve the message.<p>
Thank you,<br>
Pokeschool Staff<p>
</font>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  </center></div>
</form>


<hr width="80%" noshade size="1" color="#000000">

<p align="center"><font face="Arial">© Copyright 1999 Pokeschool 1.0<br>
<a href="mailto:webmaster@Pokeschool.com">webmaster@Pokeschool.com</a></font></p>
</body>
</html>
